pe/StructElem>>endobj504 0 obj<</E(His challenge to the room was to see the disruption as an opening rather than only a threat, to identify where new categories of digital and simulation-based work are emerging, and to position themselves early.)/K[6]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H2/T(His challenge to the room was to see the disruption as an opening rather than only a threat, to identify where new categories of digital and simulation-based work are emerging, and to position themselves early.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj511 0 obj<</A[1371 0 R 0]/K[13]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj512 0 obj<</E(3:25 … 3:55 PM)/K[14]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H5/T(3:25 … 3:55 PM)/Type/StructElem>>endobj514 0 obj<</E(Organization for Change: Discovering Your Story)/K[16]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H1/T(Organization for Change: Discovering Your Story)/Type/StructElem>>endobj509 0 obj<</A[1369 0 R 0]/K[11]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj510 0 obj<</A[1370 0 R 0]/K[12]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj515 0 obj<</E(Moderator: Yuki Yasumiba \(AAYN\))/K[17]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H4/T(Moderator: Yuki Yasumiba \(AAYN\))/Type/StructElem>>endobj516 0 obj<</E(Speaker: Marina Noda \(International Development Specialist, Umikaji Link\))/K[18]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H4/T(Speaker: Marina Noda \(International Development Specialist, Umikaji Link\))/Type/StructElem>>endobj517 0 obj<</E(Yuki Yasumiba, Co-founder of AAYN, led an interactive storytelling exercise, organizing delegates into small, deliberately mixed-nationality groups to practise sharing their personal stories. Her framing centred on the difference between facts and narrati\ve in driving social change.)/K[19]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H2/T(Yuki Yasumiba, Co-founder of AAYN, led an interactive storytelling exercise, organizing delegates into small, deliberately mixed-nationality groups to practise sharing their personal stories. Her framing centred on the difference between facts and narrati\ve in driving social change.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj508 0 obj<</A[1368 0 R 0]/K[10]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj518 0 obj<</E(Facts help you to understand, but stories help people care.)/K[20]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H2/T(Facts help you to understand, but stories help people care.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj513 0 obj<</E(- Yuki Yasumiba)/K[15]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H3/T(- Yuki Yasumiba)/Type/StructElem>>endobj521 0 obj<</A[1374 0 R 0]/K[23]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj522 0 obj<</E(4:25 … 4:45 PM)/K[24]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H5/T(4:25 … 4:45 PM)/Type/StructElem>>endobj523 0 obj<</E(Capacity Building: From Vision to Action)/K[25]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H1/T(Capacity Building: From Vision to Action)/Type/StructElem>>endobj519 0 obj<</A[1372 0 R 0]/K[21]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj520 0 obj<</A[1373 0 R 0]/K[22]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj524 0 obj<</E(Facilitators: Terry Otieno \(ADNJ\) · Yuki Yasumiba \(AAYN\))/K[26]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H4/T(Facilitators: Terry Otieno \(ADNJ\) · Yuki Yasumiba \(AAYN\))/Type/StructElem>>endobj525 0 obj<</E(A closing capacity-building session translating the day's discussions into concrete next steps, bridging the policy conversations of the morning with the practical, hands-on learning of the sessions that followed.)/K[27]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/H2/T(A closing capacity-building session translating the day's discussions into concrete next steps, bridging the policy conversations of the morning with the practical, hands-on learning of the sessions that followed.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj528 0 obj<</A[1375 0 R 0]/K[30]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj526 0 obj<</E(TICAD Youth Drive 2026 · Report)/K[28]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj527 0 obj<</E(13)/K[29]/P 161 0 R/Pg 22 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1375 0 obj<</BBox[51.81675 51.60298 543.543 52.352