ted two PhDs, one in Public Administration through the University of Burundi and one in ICT Education through a World Bank scholarship, both largely during COVID-era lockd\owns.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj457 0 obj<</A[1349 0 R 0]/K[9]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj460 0 obj<</E(Failure is an integral part of the success story.)/K[12]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/H2/T(Failure is an integral part of the success story.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj461 0 obj<</E(- Prof. Fred Awaah)/K[13]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/H4/T(- Prof. Fred Awaah)/Type/StructElem>>endobj458 0 obj<</A[1350 0 R 0]/K[10]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj462 0 obj<</E(If Fred did it, we can also do it.)/K[14]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/H2/T(If Fred did it, we can also do it.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj463 0 obj<</E( )/K[15]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj459 0 obj<</E(- Prof. Fred Awaah)/K[11]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/H3/T(- Prof. Fred Awaah)/Type/StructElem>>endobj467 0 obj<</A[1351 0 R 0]/K[19]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj452 0 obj<</A[1348 0 R 0]/K[4]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj469 0 obj<</A[1353 0 R 0]/K[21]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj454 0 obj<</E(TICAD Youth Drive 2026 · Report)/K[6]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj455 0 obj<</E(11)/K[7]/P 159 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1353 0 obj<</BBox[51.81675 51.60298 543.543 52.35298]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1348 0 obj<</BBox[189.05292 228.68408 515.4259 446.26605]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1351 0 obj<</BBox[34.474117 245.38263 182.27983 458.4629]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1350 0 obj<</BBox[349.69565 500.7569 353.44705 530.01794]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1349 0 obj<</BBox[80.23415 495.62067 83.985565 524.8817]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1352 0 obj<</BBox[2.866703 546.6509 261.49683 718.6231]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1346 0 obj<</BBo