>>endobj263 0 obj<</E(We are especially grateful to the Pan-African Youth Union, the AfCFTA Policy Network, UNECA, the Embassy of Japan in Ghana, the National Youth Authority of Ghana, and the Diaspora African Forum, for their partnership and presence throughout the Drive. Fin\ally, we thank the young delegates themselves, from Ghana, from across the African continent, and from Japan, whose energy, honesty, and willingness to take the stage made this Drive what it was. )/K[17]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/H4/T(We are especially grateful to the Pan-African Youth Union, the AfCFTA Policy Network, UNECA, the Embassy of Japan in Ghana, the National Youth Authority of Ghana, and the Diaspora African Forum, for their partnership and presence throughout the Drive. Fin\ally, we thank the young delegates themselves, from Ghana, from across the African continent, and from Japan, whose energy, honesty, and willingness to take the stage made this Drive what it was. )/Type/StructElem>>endobj264 0 obj<</E(We are grateful to Terry Otieno, Policy and Programmes Lead, Africa Diaspora Network Japan \(ADNJ\), for compiling and editing this report.)/K[18]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/H4/T(We are grateful to Terry Otieno, Policy and Programmes Lead, Africa Diaspora Network Japan \(ADNJ\), for compiling and editing this report.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj246 0 obj<</A[1271 0 R 0]/K[0]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj254 0 obj<</E(Foreword)/K[8]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/H3/T(Foreword)/Type/StructElem>>endobj255 0 obj<</E(The fourth TICAD Youth Drive brought together an extraordinary, committed community of young Africans and Japanese, gathered in Accra under a single theme: Youth Agenda 2055, From Vision to Action.)/K[9]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/H4/T(The fourth TICAD Youth Drive brought together an extraordinary, committed community of young Africans and Japanese, gathered in Accra under a single theme: Youth Agenda 2055, From Vision to Action.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj256 0 obj<</E(Of everything shared across these two days, three points stand out.)/K[10]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/H4/T(Of everything shared across these two days, three points stand out.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj257 0 obj<</E(First: the vision has become policy, and the policy has become an institution. What began as young people simply being asked what future they wanted has, over eighteen months, become Youth Agenda 2055: The Future We Want, launched at TICAD9 in Yokohama. I\n Accra, that policy took its next form: the Africa…Japan Youth Alliance, a standing, youth-owned structure with a Council, a Secretariat, and an Advisory Panel already in motion.)/K[11]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/H4/T(First: the vision has become policy, and the policy has become an institution. What began as young people simply being asked what future they wanted has, over eighteen months, become Youth Agenda 2055: The Future We Want, launched at TICAD9 in Yokohama. I\n Accra, that policy took its next form: the Africa…Japan Youth Alliance, a standing, youth-owned structure with a Council, a Secretariat, and an Advisory Panel already in motion.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj258 0 obj<</E(Second: this generation is not waiting for permission. Across nearly every session, from the keynote dialogue to the capacity-building floor, the same message surfaced independently, again and again: take action, start small, don't wait for institutions. \That convergence, unprompted and unrehearsed, is itself a form of evidence.)/K[12]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/H4/T(Second: this generation is not waiting for permission. Across nearly every session, from the keynote dialogue to the capacity-building floor, the same message surfaced independently, again and again: take action, start small, don't wait for institutions. \That convergence, unprompted and unrehearsed, is itself a form of evidence.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj259 0 obj<</A[1273 0 R 0]/K[13]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj265 0 obj<</A[1274 0 R 0]/K[19]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj252 0 obj<</E(TICAD Youth Drive 2026 · Report)/K[6]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj253 0 obj<</E(03)/K[7]/P 151 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1274 0 obj<</BBox[51.81675 51.60298 543.543 52.35298]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1273 0 obj<</BBox[59.55 302.3695 99.31499 305.37064]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1271 0 obj<</BBox[59.55 550.7676 99.31499 553.76874]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1272 0 obj<</BBox[-5.002135 586.4801 600.476 855.0813]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj11 0 obj<</Annots[]/BleedBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/Contents 2951 0 R/CropBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/MediaBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/Parent 2 0 R/Resources<</ExtGState<</GS0 858 0 R/GS1 859 0 R>>/XObject<</Fm0 50 0 R>>>>/Rotate 0/StructParents 1/Tabs/S/TrimBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/Type/Page>>endobj2951 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 206>>stream
